"XTimers and Xin Account are operated by Xintech LLC. For identity,\n      recovery, product, deletion, or SMS support, email us at" = "XTimers 和 Xin Account 均由 Xintech LLC 營運。如需身分、復原、產品、刪除或 SMS 方面的支援，請傳送電子郵件至";
"XTimers app screenshots" = "XTimers App 螢幕截圖";
"XTimers by Xintech LLC Privacy Policy" = "由 Xintech LLC 營運的 XTimers 隱私權政策";
"XTimers by Xintech LLC SMS is limited to account phone\n      verification codes and user-created reminder SMS sent only to the\n      signed-in user's own verified, opted-in account phone number. Reply STOP\n      to opt out of SMS messages. Reply HELP for help. Reply START or YES to\n      opt back in after consenting in the app. SMS is not a two-way chat\n      service." = "由 Xintech LLC 營運的 XTimers SMS 僅限帳戶電話號碼驗證碼和使用者建立的提醒 SMS，而且只會傳送到已登入使用者本人已驗證且已選擇接收的帳戶電話號碼。回覆 STOP 可取消訂閱 SMS 訊息。回覆 HELP 可取得協助。在 App 中授權後，回覆 START 或 YES 可重新選擇接收。SMS 不是雙向聊天服務。";
"XTimers currently sends email reports, verification messages, and\n      user-created reminders only to the signed-in user's own Xin Account email\n      address. SMS is sent only to the user's own verified, opted-in account\n      phone number. XTimers may process message content, delivery status,\n      scheduled time, and provider response metadata to deliver and troubleshoot\n      these messages." = "XTimers 目前僅將電子郵件報告、驗證訊息和使用者建立的提醒傳送到已登入使用者自己的 Xin Account 電子郵件地址。SMS 僅傳送到使用者自己已驗證並已選擇接收訊息的帳戶電話號碼。XTimers 可能會處理訊息內容、傳送狀態、排定時間和供應商回應中繼資料，以便傳送這些訊息並排解問題。";
"XTimers does not use the collected app data to track users across apps or\n      websites owned by other companies for advertising. Xintech LLC does not\n      sell SMS opt-in data or other app data. Xintech LLC does not share SMS\n      opt-in data, phone numbers, or text-message consent with third parties or\n      affiliates for marketing or promotional purposes." = "XTimers 不會使用所收集的 App 資料跨其他公司擁有的 App 或網站追蹤使用者以投放廣告。Xintech LLC 不會出售 SMS 選擇接收資料或其他 App 資料。Xintech LLC 不會基於行銷或宣傳目的，與第三方或關係企業分享 SMS 選擇接收資料、電話號碼或簡訊授權資訊。";
"XTimers email reports and email messages are currently limited to the\n      signed-in user's own Xin Account email address." = "XTimers 電子郵件報告和電子郵件訊息目前僅傳送到已登入使用者自己的 Xin Account 電子郵件地址。";
"XTimers for Mac" = "XTimers Mac 版";
"XTimers home" = "XTimers 首頁";
"XTimers iPad screenshot" = "XTimers iPad 螢幕截圖";
"XTimers iPad timer list in light mode" = "淺色模式下的 XTimers iPad 計時器列表";
"XTimers iPhone screenshot" = "XTimers iPhone 螢幕截圖";
"XTimers iPhone timer list in light mode" = "淺色模式下的 XTimers iPhone 計時器列表";
"XTimers is a calm Apple-native timer workspace for timers, countdowns, clocks, task sets, reports, custom sounds, and account reminders across Mac, iPhone, and iPad." = "XTimers 是適用於 Mac、iPhone 與 iPad 的 Apple 原生計時工作區，支援計時器、倒數、時鐘、任務集、報告、自訂聲音與帳號提醒。";
"XTimers is operated by Xintech LLC and uses Xin Account for shared\n      sign-in. This policy explains the information processed for Xin Account\n      identity services and for XTimers timers, countdowns, activity tracking,\n      synchronization, reports, custom sounds, reminders, support, and\n      messaging features." = "XTimers 由 Xintech LLC 營運，並使用 Xin Account 進行共用登入。本政策說明了為 Xin Account 身分服務以及 XTimers 的計時器、倒數計時、活動追蹤、同步、報告、自訂聲音、提醒、支援和訊息功能所處理的資訊。";
"XTimers macOS add countdown sheet in light mode" = "淺色模式下的 XTimers macOS 新增倒數表單";
"XTimers macOS add timer sheet in light mode" = "淺色模式下的 XTimers macOS 新增計時器表單";
"XTimers macOS expanded double-column timer window" = "XTimers macOS 展開的雙欄計時器視窗";
"XTimers macOS main timer window in light mode" = "淺色模式下的 XTimers macOS 主計時器視窗";
"XTimers may process a per-installation device identifier, push-notification\n      token, platform, app version, build number, operating-system version,\n      device model, service command or feature interaction, response status,\n      response duration, and error information. These records are used to\n      provide synchronization and notifications, operate the service, measure\n      feature use, diagnose failures, improve performance, and prevent abuse." = "XTimers 可能會處理每次安裝的裝置識別碼、推播通知權杖、平台、App 版本、建置編號、作業系統版本、裝置型號、服務指令或功能互動、回應狀態、回應時間和錯誤資訊。這些記錄用於提供同步與通知、營運服務、衡量功能使用情況、診斷故障、改善效能並防止濫用。";
"XTimers platforms" = "XTimers 平台";
"XTimers receives the IP address and user-agent information used to connect\n      to its service. For security, troubleshooting, abuse prevention, and\n      service administration, the service may retain the IP address, a derived\n      IP key, approximate country, region, city, postal area, network\n      organization, request time, command name, and a stable hashed account\n      identifier for authenticated requests. The app also submits Apple\n      MetricKit diagnostic payloads that can contain crash, hang, CPU, disk,\n      energy, and other performance or technical information." = "XTimers 會接收用來連接其服務的 IP 位址和 User-Agent 資訊。基於安全性、疑難排解、防止濫用和服務管理，服務可能會保留 IP 位址、衍生 IP 金鑰、大致的國家、地區、城市、郵遞區域、網路組織、要求時間、指令名稱，以及用於已驗證要求的穩定雜湊帳戶識別碼。App 也會提交 Apple MetricKit 診斷承載資料，其中可能包含當機、停滯、CPU、磁碟、能源以及其他效能或技術資訊。";
"XTimers uses a Xin Account to identify and authenticate a user. A Xin\n      Account is the shared identity layer for XTimers and any other connected\n      products listed in the account controls; it is not an XTimers product\n      account and does not contain XTimers timers, reports, sounds, or SMS data." = "XTimers 使用 Xin Account 來識別使用者並驗證其身分。Xin Account 是 XTimers 以及帳戶控制項中列出的其他任何已連結產品的共用身分層；它不是 XTimers 產品帳戶，也不包含 XTimers 計時器、報告、聲音或 SMS 資料。";
"XTimers uses your Xin Account for shared sign-in while XTimers keeps your timers, reports, settings, sounds, and SMS choices as XTimers product data." = "XTimers 使用您的 Xin Account 進行共用登入，同時將您的計時器、報告、設定、聲音和 SMS 選擇做為 XTimers 產品資料分開保存。";
"XTimers — Mac, iPhone, and iPad" = "XTimers — Mac、iPhone 與 iPad";
"Xin Account Identity and Recovery" = "Xin Account 身分與復原";
"Xin Account Identity and Sign-In" = "Xin Account 身分與登入";
"Xin Account identity data is retained while needed to provide the shared\n      identity and connected-product associations. XTimers product data is\n      retained while needed to provide the connected XTimers account and its\n      requested features. Published report content is unavailable after its\n      selected expiration and is removed by service cleanup. Message and\n      consent records may be retained as needed for delivery, troubleshooting,\n      abuse prevention, and carrier or legal compliance." = "Xin Account 身分資料會在提供共用身分及已連結產品關聯所需的期間內保留。XTimers 產品資料會在提供已連結 XTimers 帳戶及其所要求功能所需的期間內保留。已發佈的報告內容會在所選到期時間後無法使用，並由服務清理程序移除。訊息和同意記錄可能會根據傳送、疑難排解、防止濫用以及遵守電信業者或法律要求的需要予以保留。";
"Xin Account processes an account identifier, email address,\n      authentication and session records, linked sign-in provider records,\n      recovery and security records, account lifecycle records, and the\n      association between the Xin Account and each connected product account.\n      Xintech LLC uses this information to authenticate the user, secure and\n      recover the account, manage sessions and linked providers, authorize\n      connected-product access, prevent abuse, and provide identity support." = "Xin Account 會處理帳戶識別碼、電子郵件地址、驗證和工作階段記錄、已連結的登入供應商記錄、復原和安全性記錄、帳戶生命週期記錄，以及 Xin Account 與每個已連結產品帳戶之間的關聯。Xintech LLC 使用這些資訊來驗證使用者身分、保護和復原帳戶、管理工作階段和已連結的供應商、授權存取已連結的產品、防止濫用並提供身分支援。";
"Xin Account sign-in. XTimers data stays separate." = "使用 Xin Account 登入。XTimers 資料保持獨立。";
"Xintech LLC uses administrative, technical, and organizational measures\n      intended to protect XTimers information. No storage or transmission system\n      can be guaranteed to be completely secure." = "Xintech LLC 採用管理、技術和組織措施來保護 XTimers 資訊。任何儲存或傳輸系統都無法保證絕對安全。";
"Xintech LLC uses service providers for identity and authentication, cloud\n      hosting and storage, email and SMS delivery, push notifications,\n      diagnostics, and website analytics. These providers may process\n      information only as needed to perform services for Xintech LLC, subject\n      to their applicable terms and privacy safeguards. Email and SMS providers\n      receive the recipient, requested message content, and delivery metadata\n      needed to send the user's message." = "Xintech LLC 使用服務供應商來提供身分和驗證、雲端代管和儲存、電子郵件和 SMS 傳送、推播通知、診斷以及網站分析服務。這些供應商只能在為 Xintech LLC 提供服務所需的範圍內處理資訊，並須遵守其適用條款和隱私權保障。電子郵件和 SMS 供應商會收到傳送使用者訊息所需的收件者資訊、使用者所要求的訊息內容和傳送中繼資料。";
"Your Xin Account identifies you and authorizes each connected XTimers account." = "您的 Xin Account 會識別您的身分，並授權每個已連結的 XTimers 帳戶。";
